1. Basic CI Concept  
Continuous Integration (CI) means automatically building and testing software whenever changes are made.  
In our practical:  
Selenium TestNG Project  
        ↓  
      Jenkins  
        ↓  
   Build Project  
        ↓  
 Execute Test Cases  
        ↓  
 TestNG Results  
        ↓  
 Generate Report  
        ↓  Analyze Build History 
   
2. Requirements  
1.	Windows computer  
2.	Java JDK  
3.	Eclipse  
4.	Selenium WebDriver  
5.	TestNG  
6.	Jenkins  
